     A*  MEDICARE 2ND PAY DATA EXTRACT MASTER FILE
     A*
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PD101                     TEXT('MEDICARE EXTRACT MASTER FILE')
     A            D1CO#     R     S         REFFLD(CO#)
     A                                      COLHDG('CO#')
     A            D1FND     R     S         REFFLD(FND)
     A                                      COLHDG('GROUP')
     A            D1EXDT    R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('EXTRACT DATE')
     A            D1RSDT    R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('RESPONSE DATE')
     A*
     A* MAINTENANCE INFORMATION
     A*
     A            D1USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            D1PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            D1TIME    R     S         REFFLD(TIME)
     A            D1DT      R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            D1IUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
     A            D1IPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'PROGRAM')
     A            D1ITIM    R     S         REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'TIME')
     A            D1IDT     R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
